  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hablando con los chefs de la ciudad, muchas\nveces sale tu nombre en la conversación...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¿Hay algo que debería saber de ti, Albado?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Soy como cualquier otro rufián de esta ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F007900200063006F006D006F0020006300750061006C007100750069006500720020006F00740072006F0020007200750066006900E1006E002000640065002000650073007400610020006300690075006400610064002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una vez conocí a un chef que se desvivía tratando\nde hacer más sabrosos los platillos, a pesar de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsu fugaz existencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Su devoción por la gastronomía me inspiró.\nEso es todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750020006400650076006F0063006900F3006E00200070006F00720020006C0061002000670061007300740072006F006E006F006D00ED00610020006D006500200069006E007300700069007200F3002E000A00450073006F00200065007300200074006F0064006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque veo que no soy el único perfeccionista.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTanto la cocción del croissant como la cantidad\nde sal son perfectas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cocina es una ciencia exacta. Si sigues las\nmedidas e instrucciones, nada puede salir mal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además, he entrenado a mis Pokémon para que\najusten la temperatura de sus movimientos de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntipo Fuego con gran precisión, grado por grado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Increíble! Con ese talento, no me extraña que\nseas un Entrenador famoso.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así es! Mi equipo y yo sabemos dejar al rival\nen su punto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007300ED00200065007300210020004D0069002000650071007500690070006F0020007900200079006F00200073006100620065006D006F0073002000640065006A0061007200200061006C00200072006900760061006C000A0065006E002000730075002000700075006E0074006F002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se ve que son bien quisquillosos con la comida.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065002000760065002000710075006500200073006F006E0020006200690065006E00200071007500690073007100750069006C006C006F0073006F007300200063006F006E0020006C006100200063006F006D006900640061002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cualquier cosa sabe rica después de un largo día\nde trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006C0071007500690065007200200063006F00730061002000730061006200650020007200690063006100200064006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E0020006C006100720067006F0020006400ED0061000A00640065002000740072006100620061006A006F002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Grisela! ¿Quieres pelear a mi lado?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470072006900730065006C00610021002000BF0051007500690065007200650073002000700065006C006500610072002000610020006D00690020006C00610064006F003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está bien. Después de un combate, también sabe\ntodo mejor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E10020006200690065006E002E00200044006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200073006100620065000A0074006F0064006F0020006D0065006A006F0072002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ese caso, necesitaré tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200065007300650020006300610073006F002C0020006E0065006300650073006900740061007200E9002000740075002000610079007500640061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por supuesto",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te esperamos en la arena.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020006500730070006500720061006D006F007300200065006E0020006C00610020006100720065006E0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Va a ser un combate muy duro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100200061002000730065007200200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400650020006D007500790020006400750072006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero mostrarle a Albado mi admiración con\nun combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100510075006900650072006F0020006D006F00730074007200610072006C00650020006100200041006C006200610064006F0020006D0069002000610064006D0069007200610063006900F3006E00200063006F006E000A0075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Di que sí, di que sí. Hazlo por Grisel, a ver si así\nse calla de una vez por todas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a ganar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061002000670061006E0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La sangre me hierve de tal manera que me\nhace arder por dentro, ¡vamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mi compañero los incinerará con sus oscuras\nllamas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F0020006C006F007300200069006E00630069006E006500720061007200E100200063006F006E00200073007500730020006F007300630075007200610073000A006C006C0061006D00610073002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Date prisa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006100740065002000700072006900730061002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Los voy a hacer pedazos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006F007300200076006F00790020006100200068006100630065007200200070006500640061007A006F0073002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000740075002000610079007500640061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Charizard, megaevoluciona y que tus llamas\ndevoren y deslumbren a todos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El nombre de nuestro grupo significa cambio y\nvida nueva. ¡Como la megaevolución!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuento contigo, Skarmory! ¡Ayúdame a proteger\nla reputación del clan!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdí, pero al menos pude mostrarle a\nAlbado mi ferviente ambición.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006400ED002C0020007000650072006F00200061006C0020006D0065006E006F0073002000700075006400650020006D006F00730074007200610072006C006500200061000A0041006C006200610064006F0020006D00690020006600650072007600690065006E0074006500200061006D006200690063006900F3006E002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama del cocinero que arde en mi interior\nes más grande que nunca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, sí, lo que tú digas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nToma esto como agradecimiento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C0020007300ED002C0020006C006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000640069006700610073002E00100001BE01000A0054006F006D00610020006500730074006F00200063006F006D006F002000610067007200610064006500630069006D00690065006E0074006F002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recibiste la Camisa de barista de Grisel\nde color alternativo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500630069006200690073007400650020006C0061002000430061006D00690073006100200064006500200062006100720069007300740061002000640065002000470072006900730065006C000A0064006500200063006F006C006F007200200061006C007400650072006E0061007400690076006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te quedaría bien con un peinado como el\nde Grisel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065002000710075006500640061007200ED00610020006200690065006E00200063006F006E00200075006E0020007000650069006E00610064006F00200063006F006D006F00200065006C000A00640065002000470072006900730065006C002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los buenos encuentros nos guían en la dirección\ncorrecta...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00730020006200750065006E006F007300200065006E006300750065006E00740072006F00730020006E006F007300200067007500ED0061006E00200065006E0020006C00610020006400690072006500630063006900F3006E000A0063006F007200720065006300740061002E002E002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Seré el mejor cocinero y el mejor Entrenador!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530065007200E900200065006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200063006F00630069006E00650072006F0020007900200065006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F0072002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Después de un combate así, me comería\ncualquier cosa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200061007300ED002C0020006D006500200063006F006D0065007200ED0061000A006300750061006C0071007500690065007200200063006F00730061002E002E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"Como, luego existo\". Es mi nuevo lema.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00220043006F006D006F002C0020006C007500650067006F002000650078006900730074006F0022002E0020004500730020006D00690020006E007500650076006F0020006C0065006D0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    }
